  "text": "\r\n\t\t Election Results | Bedford, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Boards & Commissions   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     Business   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \nStay Informed \nGet news and updates sent right to your phone or inbox! \r\n\t\t\t Sign up for Notifications \r\n\t\t\t Voter Registration \r\n\t\t\t\t Application Information \r\n\t\t\t\t Determining Applicant Qualifications \r\n\t\t\t Filing for Office \r\n\t\t\t Candidates for Office \r\n\t\t\t ELECTION TRAFFIC \r\n\t\t\t Town Moderator Announcements \r\n\t\t\t Public Notice - Electronic Ballot Counting Device Testing \r\n\t\t\t Public Notice - Ballot Counting \r\n\t\t\t Legal Notice Protest Petition \r\nHome \nDepartments \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \nElection Information \nElection Results \r\nElection Results\t\t \r\nWelcome to the Town of Bedford Election Results page. Click below for results of state, federal, and local elections for the past ten years.  Click  HERE  for number of registered voters, total number of ballots cast, number of absentee ballots cast, and number of Election Day registrations dating back to 2002. \n***FOR THE SEPTEMBER 8, 2026 PRIMARY RESULTS, SCROLL DOWN TO THE BOTTOM OF THIS PAGE. \n9 \n1 \n1 \n1 \t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t2008 election results\r\n2008 results \r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\t2009 Election Results\r\n2009 election results \r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\t2010 Election Results\r\n2010 Election Results \r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\t2011 Election Results\r\n2011 Election Results \r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\t2012 Election Results\r\n2012 Election Results \r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\t2013 Election Results\r\n2013 Election Results \r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\t2014 Election Results\r\n2014 Election Results \r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\t2015 Election Results\r\n2015 Election Results \r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\t2016 Election Results\r\n2016 Election Results \r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\t2017 Election Results\r\n2017 Election Results \r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\t2018 Election Results\r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\t2019 Election Results\r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\t2020 Election Results\r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\t2021 Election Results\r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\t2022 Election Results\r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\t2023 Election Results\r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\t2024 Election Results\r\n2024 Election Results \r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\t2025 Election Results\r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n2026 Elections \nRESULTS \nNH State Primary - September 8, 2026 \nState General Election - November 3, 2026 \nBedford High School \n7:00AM - 7:00PM \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & \nMeetings \r\n\t\t\t Maps & \nProperty \nInformation \r\n\t\t\t Online \nPayments \r\n\t\t\t Transfer \nStation & \nRecycling \r\n\t\t\t Licenses \n& Permits \r\n\t\t\t Job \nOpenings \r\nContact Us \r\nBedford Town Offices \r\n24 North Amherst Road \r\nBedford, NH 03110 \nPhone:  603-472-5242 \r\nStaff Directory \r\nTown Offices Hours \r\nMonday through Friday: \n8 am to 4:30 pm \nTuesday: \n7 am to 4:30 pm \r\nTransfer Station Hours \r\nSunday and Monday: \nClosed \nTuesday: \n7 am to 5 pm \nWednesday and Friday: \n8:30 am to 5 pm \nThursday: \n8:30 am to 7 pm \nSaturday: \n6:30 am to 3 pm \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Government Websites by CivicPlus® \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
